Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; EN: Graphics settings for the ROG Ally. Double-click, accept, and restart Windows.
;     HwSchMode=1: HAGS (hardware-accelerated GPU scheduling) off; with HAGS the AMD driver gave blue screen 0x119.
;     TdrDelay=10: Windows waits 10 s (instead of 2) before resetting the GPU during a long shader compile.
;     To undo it: deshacer_ajustes_ally.reg
; ES: Ajustes de graficos para la ROG Ally. Doble clic, aceptar y reiniciar Windows.
;     HwSchMode=1: HAGS (programacion de GPU acelerada por hardware) apagado; con HAGS el driver AMD dio BSOD 0x119.
;     TdrDelay=10: Windows espera 10 s (en vez de 2) antes de reiniciar la GPU durante una compilacion larga de shaders.
;     Para deshacerlo: deshacer_ajustes_ally.reg

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\GraphicsDrivers]
"HwSchMode"=dword:00000001
"TdrDelay"=dword:0000000a
